    "body": "Another use case for an `OffscreenCanvas` would be to decode both specific time slice of one or more video files represented as `ArrayBuffer` (in addition to an `HTMLVideoElement`), possibly faster than real-time, returning only those portions of one or more files as `ImageBitmap`s.",
